      <h2>Privacy Policy – EconSoul</h2>
      <p>The <strong>EconSoul</strong> app does not collect, store, or process any personal user data. It does not require user registration and it does not use cookies or device identifiers.</p>
      <p>In‑app purchases (e.g., Premium, Donate) are securely processed through the relevant store (e.g., Google Play, Microsoft Store) under their own Terms of Service and Privacy Policies. EconSoul does not receive or store any payment details.</p>
      <p>The app may store minimal preferences locally on your device (such as language selection) solely to improve usability. These preferences never leave your device.</p>
      <p>If you have questions about this policy, please contact:</p>
